menu "Camera Photo App"

    config CAMERA_PHOTO_NAND_START_PAGE
        int "First logical NAND page used for photo storage"
        default 64
        range 1 2147483647
        help
            Logical page index where the photo catalog and JPEG files are stored.
            This region will be overwritten by saved photos.

    config CAMERA_PHOTO_MAX_COUNT
        int "Maximum number of photos stored on NAND"
        default 64
        range 1 256
        help
            Maximum number of JPEG files tracked by the on-flash catalog.

    config CAMERA_PHOTO_USB_MSC
        bool "Enable USB High-Speed MSC photo export (U-disk)"
        default n
        help
            Expose a FAT partition over USB OTG so a PC can browse exported
            JPEG files under DCIM/.

            When enabled, also configure in menuconfig:
            - Partition Table -> Custom partition table CSV (partitions.csv)
            - Component config -> TinyUSB -> Enable Mass Storage Class (MSC)

            sdkconfig.defaults keeps this disabled and uses SINGLE_APP_LARGE.

endmenu
